   "url": "https://www.war.gov/News/Transcripts/Transcript/Article/4466209/honorable-jay-hurst-and-lt-gen-steven-whitney-hold-press-briefing-on-the-depart/",
   "text": "We're applying new technology to help us reconcile data, right? Generative AI is a game changer for that. The Marine Corps passed their audit through brute force. They get a lot of people to look at Excel sheets and reconcile data. We can do that with technology now. And so, it's really changing how we approach the audit and our likelihood of achieving one within this administration.",
